<div class="page-body is-centered">

    <p>Hello, my name is Clint. I'm a software engineer, photographer and dad in Minneapolis, Minnesota. I run <a href="https://parkasoftware.com">Parka Software</a>, a boutique software consulting company.</p>

<p>This is the place where I write about technology, coffee and a handful of side projects that I've got going on.</p>

<p>Aside from my day job, I brew Chemex pour overs and take pictures of the city with my Ricoh GRIIIx, which end up at <a href="https://photos.clintmcmahon.com">photos.clintmcmahon.com</a>. I'm still trying to figure out a perfect espresso.</p>

<p>Drop me a line at <a href="mailto:clintmcmahon@pm.me">clintmcmahon@pm.me</a> if you want to talk about coffee, photography or just to say hello. I love it when people email me.</p>

